  "notes": "Ministry of Education Sector Plan 2024-2030: basic education is Grades 1-9 from age six (free and compulsory under the 1992 General Law on Education), secondary is Grades 10-12. Grade 9 ends basic education with a national exam; secondary years are named first to third secondary (الصف الأول/الثاني/الثالث الثانوي). The ESP is published by the Ministry and hosted by Education Out Loud (GPE)."
